Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.04,0:00:03.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RAJESH: Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.55,0:00:06.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gentlemen, I put it to you:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.55,0:00:06.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 我告诉你们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.01,0:00:08.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The worst tapioca pudding...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.01,0:00:08.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最难吃的木薯淀粉布丁…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:12.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is better than the best pudding of any other flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:12.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也比任何其他口味的布丁好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}First off, that is axiomatically wrong because the best pudding is chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}首先 这个原则有误 因为最棒的布丁是巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Secondly, the organic structure of tapioca makes it a jiggling bowl of potential death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其次 木薯淀粉的有机结构 有可能让人一命呜呼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:27.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It is extracted from the plant-- -Hey, I'm thinking of growing a mustache.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:27.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-它是植物的萃取物… -我在考虑留胡子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:29.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:29.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.45,0:00:32.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-A Fu Manchu, a handlebar, pencil? -It's extracted from--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.45,0:00:32.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-傅满洲式、翘八字胡或两头尖？ -它是萃取自…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not sure yet. You know, George Clooney has one now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还不确定 乔治克鲁尼也留小胡子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.28,0:00:37.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? I once saw him shopping at Ralphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.28,0:00:37.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？有一次我看见他在超市购物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:38.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was buying tequila.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:38.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他买龙舌兰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:43.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, you'd think a guy like that would have some kind of booze lackey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:43.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还以为他这种人能获得免费赠酒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.59,0:00:48.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, this is cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.59,0:00:48.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 这样太残忍了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.97,0:00:51.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We better let him finish before his head explodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.97,0:00:51.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们最好让他说完 以免他的头爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:53.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Sheldon, why is tapioca--?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:53.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 谢尔顿 木薯淀粉为何…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:56.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tapioca is extracted from the root of Manihot esculenta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:56.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}木薯淀粉是花叶木薯根的萃取物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.47,0:00:58.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Due to a high concentration of cyanide...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.47,0:00:58.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}由于高浓度的氰化物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:01:01.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it is poisonous in its raw form and lethal if prepared improperly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:01:01.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}植物本身有毒性 若没妥善料理可能致命
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.31,0:01:05.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Feel better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.31,0:01:05.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感觉舒坦多了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.98,0:01:09.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's indigenous to Brazil, as is the cocoa bean from which we get chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.98,0:01:09.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它的原产地是巴西 就像萃取出巧克力的可可树
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.69,0:01:12.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You promised you wouldn't do that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.69,0:01:12.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你保证绝不再这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.49,0:01:16.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-[LISPS] Hey, Hofstadter. -Hey, Kripke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.49,0:01:16.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 霍夫斯塔特 -嘿 克里普基
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.78,0:01:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heard about your anti-proton decay experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.78,0:01:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我听说了你的反质子衰变实验
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:22.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Twenty thousand data runs and no statistically significant results.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:22.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跑了两万个数据 依旧没有确切的统计结果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.42,0:01:24.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.42,0:01:24.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真佩服你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.25,0:01:27.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.25,0:01:27.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他真是个混帐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:31.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't feel bad, Leonard. Negative results are still results.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:31.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别难过 莱纳德 阴性结果也算有结果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.34,0:01:34.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Even 20,000 of them. LEONARD: All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.34,0:01:34.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-即使是两万次 -好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.51,0:01:37.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please don't cheer me up anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.51,0:01:37.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请别再安慰我了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.64,0:01:39.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, don't let him get to you. It's Kripke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.64,0:01:39.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别被他影响 他是克里普基
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.10,0:01:42.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, he's a ginormous knob.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.10,0:01:42.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 他是超级大混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.77,0:01:46.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's why he eats by himself instead of sitting here at the cool table.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.77,0:01:46.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以他一个人吃饭 而不是和酷小伙们同桌用餐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:49.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For shizzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一点都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:56.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, it's true, Kripke lacks the basic social skills that we take for granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:56.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 克里普基缺乏被我们 视为理所当然的社交技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.99,0:02:00.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But he controls the new Open Science Grid computer...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.99,0:02:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他控制全新的公开科学网格电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.41,0:02:04.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that I need to run simulations of structure formation in the early universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.41,0:02:04.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我需要用来模拟 早期宇宙的结构组成
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.37,0:02:08.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good luck getting time on it. The only people he lets use it are his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.37,0:02:08.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得自求多福 他只让他的朋友进去使用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.29,0:02:10.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, then, the solution is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.29,0:02:10.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么解决方式很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.59,0:02:12.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I shall befriend him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.59,0:02:12.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我应该和他交朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.72,0:02:14.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kripke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.72,0:02:14.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克里普基
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:16.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:16.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:19.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What would you say to the idea of you and I becoming friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:19.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你我交个朋友如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:21.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I would say...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:21.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:24.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I have no interest in becoming your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我完全不想成为你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.89,0:02:28.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Oh, that seems rather shortsighted...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.89,0:02:28.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？你真是短视
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.23,0:02:31.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...coming from someone who is considered altogether unlikable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.23,0:02:31.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你向来是个不受欢迎的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.15,0:02:35.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Take some time to reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.15,0:02:35.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我给你时间重新考虑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:36.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:36.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.41,0:02:37.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KRIPKE SCOFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:41.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I think we're off to a terrific start.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:41.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为这是个很好的开始
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:09.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There you go. Now any e-mail from Wolowitz...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:09.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 沃洛维茨寄的所有信件
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:11.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...will go right into your spam folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:11.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都会直接过滤为垃圾邮件
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:14.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks. The e-mail doesn't bother me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 这些电邮我还能忍受
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:17.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as much as the vacation pictures of him in a bathing suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:17.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他穿游泳衣的度假照片比较烦人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.03,0:03:20.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I got the same one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.03,0:03:20.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我也看了那一张
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:23.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that's not a bathing suit, it's a tan line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:23.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是游泳衣 是晒黑的线条
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.37,0:03:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, this is Sheldon Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.37,0:03:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 我是谢尔顿库珀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.13,0:03:34.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am leaving a message for Barry Kripke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.13,0:03:34.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要留言给贝瑞克里普基
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:39.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Barry, it was pleasant seeing you today in the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:39.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝瑞 今天在餐厅里看见你真高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:42.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I saw that you purchased the chef's salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:42.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看见你购买主厨沙拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.35,0:03:44.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently, you did not know that the chef's salad...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.35,0:03:44.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显然你不知道主厨沙拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:48.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is kitchen trickery to utilize scrap meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:48.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是厨师利用废弃的肉的把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.65,0:03:52.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nevertheless, I hope you enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.65,0:03:52.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无论如何 希望你吃得愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.44,0:03:54.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm following up on our pending friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.44,0:03:54.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想知道我俩之间友谊的进展
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:59.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I look forward to hearing from you regarding its status.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}期待你来电告知状况
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:01.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:01.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿库珀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:06.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's up with Ichabod?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:06.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊卡博德是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.96,0:04:08.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, he's trying to make a new friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.96,0:04:08.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他想交新朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.87,0:04:10.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, really? Well, good for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.87,0:04:10.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？真是不错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:13.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unless he makes one out of wood like Geppetto...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:13.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非他能像老木匠一样雕出小木偶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I don't think it's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}否则就不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:18.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, how did you guys become friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:18.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们怎么会成为朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:21.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There was a flyer on the bulletin board at the university:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:21.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大学的布告栏上有一张传单…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:25.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Roommate wanted. Whistlers need not apply."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:25.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}征室友 吹口哨者请勿应征
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.97,0:04:27.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you moved in anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.97,0:04:27.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而你依旧搬进去？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.31,0:04:29.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I assumed he was joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.31,0:04:29.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为他在开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.27,0:04:33.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd be surprised how many particle physicists have a whimsical side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.27,0:04:33.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你或许惊讶 但很多分子物理学家其实相当古怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.73,0:04:36.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about Howard and Raj? How did he become friends with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.73,0:04:36.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德和拉吉呢？ 你怎么会和他们成为朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:39.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. How do carbon atoms form a benzene ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:39.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道 碳原子如何形成苯环？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.95,0:04:42.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Proximity and valence electrons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.95,0:04:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接近性与价电子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.74,0:04:46.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, yeah, sure, when you put it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.74,0:04:46.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 你这样比喻真贴切
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:49.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it all worked out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:49.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但结果很好 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:50.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:50.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.46,0:04:52.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do miss whistling though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.46,0:04:52.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我很怀念吹口哨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, come on. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:55.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[WHISTLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第一次警告
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}First warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.72,0:05:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.72,0:05:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.93,0:05:03.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny. Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.93,0:05:03.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:06.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:06.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:08.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:08.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.35,0:05:11.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.35,0:05:11.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:16.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What is this? -It's a questionnaire I devised.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:16.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是什么？ -我设计的问卷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.23,0:05:19.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm having some difficulty bonding with a colleague at work...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.23,0:05:19.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我和一位同事在相处方面出了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.28,0:05:23.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so I'm doing a little research to better understand why my current friends like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.28,0:05:23.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我要做研究 更加了解我目前的朋友为何喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.78,0:05:27.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, well, that is a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.78,0:05:27.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 这是个好问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.95,0:05:30.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But is this really the best way to figure it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.95,0:05:30.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但这真是找出答案的最好方式吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.66,0:05:31.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.66,0:05:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我同意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The social sciences are largely hokum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}社会科学都是鬼扯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:37.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But short of putting electrodes in your brain and monitoring your response...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:37.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但除了在你脑袋贴电极片 观察我在你身边时…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:40.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to my companionship, this is the best I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:40.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你出现的反应 这是退而求其次的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:42.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, question one:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 第一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:46.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Rank the following aspects of Sheldon Cooper in order of appeal:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:46.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请依据以下的迷人特质 评估谢尔顿库珀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.85,0:05:49.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Intelligence, ruthless attention to hygiene...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.85,0:05:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}智慧、一丝不苟的个人卫生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:53.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...playfulness, Java-applet writing"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:53.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开朗外向 写Java程序的功力？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:57.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. I may have started off with a fairly obvious one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:57.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 第一点太明显了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.69,0:06:00.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}An aspect of my most appealing trait:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.69,0:06:00.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我最吸引人的特质是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.15,0:06:02.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}playfulness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.15,0:06:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开朗外向
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:05.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you rank that number one? You're on your own for the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:05.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你把那个列为第一点吧 剩下部分你得自己完成
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:07.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It should take you no more than three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:07.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该不会花超过三小时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:10.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, wait, how many questions are on this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:10.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 上面究竟有几个问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Only 211.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有211个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't worry. I've kept them all at a high-school graduate reading level.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:18.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别担心 为了你 我设计得 连高中毕业生都看得懂这些问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:20.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:20.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:23.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You got it, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:23.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题 妹子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:27.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, honey, did you ever consider making friends by being...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:27.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 亲爱的 你有没有想过 交朋友时应该…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:30.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I don't know, pleasant?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:30.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道 讨人喜欢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.60,0:06:33.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that's certainly a thought-provoking hypothesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.60,0:06:33.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这真是发人深省的假设
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.39,0:06:36.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}May I suggest it as the topic for your essay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.39,0:06:36.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我能建议它成为你论文的主题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:45.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tsk, tsk, tsk. Your questionnaire, very disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:45.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的问卷非常令人失望
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.45,0:06:50.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I answered every question, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.45,0:06:50.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我回答了所有问题 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:53.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You answered the multiple choice questions in a pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:53.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你用固定的模式回答选择题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:58.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A-B-B-A-C, A-B-B-A-C.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:58.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}ABBAC…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:02.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, you picked up on that, huh? -Yeah, wait--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:02.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-被你发现了 -等一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:04.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How could I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:04.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怎么不会发现？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.22,0:07:07.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, uh, come on. There's over 200 questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.22,0:07:08.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 有超过两百个问题 你瞧瞧某些题目
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:08.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And look at some of these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:13.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Sheldon is to camaraderie as the space shuttle is to blank."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:13.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿之于忠诚同志 就像太空梭之于什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:18.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are a number of acceptable answers. For example, C, near-Earth transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:18.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有很多可接受的答案 例如C 近地传输
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But certainly not B, avocado rancher.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但绝对不是B 酪梨农夫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.11,0:07:25.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your essay: I'd have better luck making friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.11,0:07:25.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的论文说等到赛隆人占领地球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.61,0:07:28.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...if I wait till the Cylons take over?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.61,0:07:28.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我比较可能交到朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:33.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold on. I put some real work into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:33.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 我写得很认真
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.24,0:07:35.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, well, it's better than what Wolowitz did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.24,0:07:35.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 至少比沃洛维茨的答案好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:40.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He drew a raccoon with what appears to be a distended scrotum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:40.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他画了一只浣熊 还有看似肿胀的阴囊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.38,0:07:43.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's kind of cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.38,0:07:43.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}挺可爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:47.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Uh, till you get to the scrotum. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:47.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-直到看见阴囊为止 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.63,0:07:51.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What hope do I have for establishing new relationships, given that my friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.63,0:07:51.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还有什么交到新朋友的机会 连我目前的朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.89,0:07:54.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...could not take a few hours out of their lives to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.89,0:07:54.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显然都不愿意花几小时帮助我？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.93,0:07:58.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, Sheldon, I'm not going to defend a big-balled raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.93,0:07:58.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我不会替阴囊肿大的浣熊辩护
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:00.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I don't see how you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:00.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你也没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:04.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ugh. What I'm trying to say is that you can't approach this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:04.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想说的是或许你不该用 死板的问卷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:06.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as a purely intellectual exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:06.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}获得你要的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.49,0:08:09.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.49,0:08:09.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这话什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.91,0:08:14.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, ahh, remember when you tried to learn how to swim using the Internet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.91,0:08:14.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记得你曾经从网上 试着学习游泳吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:17.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did learn how to swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:17.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的确学到怎么游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:20.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:20.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在地板上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.25,0:08:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The skills are transferable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.25,0:08:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这项技术也能应用在水里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just have no interest in going in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是不想泡到水里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:27.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then why learn how to swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:27.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你干嘛要学游泳？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:29.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The ice caps are melting, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:29.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冰帽正在溶化 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:32.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the future, swimming isn't going to be optional.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:32.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将来你不想游泳也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:36.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you do bring up an interesting point. I don't have to break new ground here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:36.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你的确提出了有趣的观点 我没必要探索新领域
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.89,0:08:38.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sure the research already exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.89,0:08:38.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我确定很多研究已经存在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.35,0:08:43.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. No, my point is if you wanna learn how to make friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.35,0:08:43.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我的意思是若你想学着交朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.36,0:08:46.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...then just go out to a coffee shop or a museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.36,0:08:46.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去咖啡厅或美术馆就好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:49.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meet people. Talk to them. Take an interest in their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:49.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}认识别人 和他们聊天 多去了解他们的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:52.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's insane on the face of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:52.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来太荒谬了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:55.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Come on. -Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:55.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-走吧 -我们要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:57.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're driving me to the mall to acquire a book...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:57.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要载我去购物中心 我要买一本书
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:09:01.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that summarizes the current theories in the field of friend making.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:09:01.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}详述交友领域的最新理论
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:06.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you just lie down on the floor and swim there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:06.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你何不就躺在地板上游泳到那里？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:13.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Coping With the Death of a Loved One."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:13.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《面对挚爱的死亡》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:17.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-My condolences. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:17.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-请节哀 -谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:18.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Family or friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:18.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}家人还是朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.06,0:09:20.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Family. -Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.06,0:09:20.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-家人 -太不幸了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.35,0:09:24.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it had been a friend, I'm available to fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.35,0:09:24.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果是朋友的话 我就能填补这个空缺
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:33.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just as well. She smelled like mothballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:33.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无所谓 她浑身散发樟脑丸的臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.53,0:09:37.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, if you're gonna start sniffing people, I'm gonna go get a hot pretzel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.53,0:09:37.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 若你要开始闻别人 我就先去买热椒盐卷饼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:40.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:40.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.12,0:09:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you have any books about making friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.12,0:09:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里有关于交朋友的书籍吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:45.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, yeah, but they're all for kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:45.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 但都是儿童图书
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:48.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I assume the skills can be extrapolated and transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:48.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想交友技巧不分年龄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.92,0:09:51.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, I guess. They're right over there by the wooden train set.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.92,0:09:51.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想是的 这些书在那边的木头火车旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh! I love trains.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我最爱火车了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.93,0:09:58.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I bet you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.93,0:09:58.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这还用说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.31,0:10:04.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my, that's awfully sticky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.31,0:10:04.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 好黏
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.61,0:10:10.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.61,0:10:10.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:16.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Bernie Bunny Has Two Daddies Now."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:16.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《柏尼兔有两个爸爸了》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.66,0:10:19.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's probably about homosexual rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.66,0:10:19.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这可能是关于同性恋兔子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Gerry the Gerbil and the Bullies on the Bus."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《沙鼠杰瑞与巴士上的流氓》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:26.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Read it, not helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:26.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}读过了 没帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.34,0:10:30.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh. Well, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.34,0:10:30.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.17,0:10:33.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Stu the Cockatoo is New at the Zoo."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.17,0:10:33.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《动物园的新生凤头鹦鹉史都》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:36.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Author Sarah Carpenter...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:36.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}作者莎拉卡本特
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.64,0:10:39.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...lives in Fort Wayne, Indiana...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.64,0:10:39.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}住在印地安纳州的韦恩堡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:42.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with her husband and best friend, Mark...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:42.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}与她丈夫和最好的朋友马克
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.52,0:10:44.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and their cockatoo, Stu."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.52,0:10:44.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}与他们的凤头鹦鹉史都
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.69,0:10:49.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hardly makes her an expert in making friends, wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.69,0:10:49.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她根本不算交友专家 你同意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.19,0:10:51.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't like birds. They scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.19,0:10:51.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不喜欢鸟类 它们让我害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:54.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.15,0:10:57.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Most people don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.15,0:10:57.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大多数的人不了解
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在读什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:02.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Curious George.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:02.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《好奇猴乔治》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.54,0:11:04.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I do like monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.54,0:11:04.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.37,0:11:05.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Curious George is a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.37,0:11:05.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好奇乔治就是一只猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Somewhat anthropomorphized, but yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将动物拟人化 但是没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.59,0:11:12.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.59,0:11:12.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不如这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.59,0:11:15.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...maybe sometime you and I could go see monkeys together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.59,0:11:15.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许某天你我能一起去看猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:17.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Would you like that? -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:17.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你愿意吗？ -好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.05,0:11:19.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.05,0:11:19.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.30,0:11:22.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm making friends with this little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.30,0:11:22.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在和这个小女孩交朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:24.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's your name? -Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:24.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你叫什么名字？ -瑞贝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:26.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Rebecca. I'm your new friend, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:26.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 瑞贝卡 我是你的新朋友谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, you're not. Let's go. -I--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你并不是 我们走 -等一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.36,0:11:30.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were really hitting it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.36,0:11:30.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们已经一拍即合
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:33.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't look up, there's cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:33.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别往上看 有摄像头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:40.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm curious, in the "How Well Do You Know Sheldon?" section...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:40.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很好奇 在“你多了解谢尔顿”单元
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:43.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...what did you put for his favorite amino acid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:43.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他最爱的氨基酸 你写的哪一种？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:45.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN UNISON] Lysine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:45.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-离氨基酸 -离氨基酸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.29,0:11:47.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn it, I had lysine and changed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.29,0:11:47.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该死 原本我也写离氨基酸 但是改掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.92,0:11:50.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good. You're just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.92,0:11:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 你们来得正是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:54.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I believe I've isolated the algorithm for making friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:54.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我设计出了交朋友的演算系统
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.34,0:11:57.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, there is no algorithm for making friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.34,0:11:57.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 交朋友并没有演算公式
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:12:01.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hear him out. If he's onto something, we could open a booth at Comic-Con...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:12:01.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听听他怎么说 若他有所发现 我们就能在漫画展上摆个摊位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.10,0:12:03.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...make a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.10,0:12:03.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大赚一笔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You see, my initial approach to Kripke had the same deficiencies...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}起初我接近克里普基时犯了错误
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:10.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as those that plagued Stu the Cockatoo when he was new at the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:10.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和刚到动物园时的 凤头鹦鹉史都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:13.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stu the Cockatoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:13.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凤头鹦鹉史都？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:16.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. He's new at the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:16.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 它是动物园里的新生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:19.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a terrific book. I've distilled its essence into a simple flow chart...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:19.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这本书非常精彩 我已经将摘要画成简易流程图
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.78,0:12:21.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that will guide me through the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.78,0:12:22.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}引导我完成整个过程
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:22.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[HOWARD SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.74,0:12:24.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you thought about putting him in a crate...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.74,0:12:24.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有没有想过在出门之前
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:27.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...while you're out of the apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:27.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把他塞进一个箱子里？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:30.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Kripke. Yeah, Sheldon Cooper here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:30.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 克里普基 我是谢尔顿库珀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.38,0:12:33.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It occurred to me you hadn't returned any of my calls...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.38,0:12:33.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我突然想到你完全没回我电话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.29,0:12:37.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because I hadn't offered any suggestions for pursuing our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.29,0:12:37.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我尚未针对建立友谊 提出具体的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:42.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, perhaps the two of us might share a meal together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:42.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我们俩应该一起吃顿饭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.43,0:12:43.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.43,0:12:43.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我了解
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.85,0:12:47.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, then perhaps you'd have time for a hot beverage?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.85,0:12:47.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你或许有时间一起喝杯热饮？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.98,0:12:51.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Popular choices include tea, coffee, cocoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.98,0:12:51.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}受欢迎的选择包括茶、咖啡和可可
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:54.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see. No, no, no, wait. Don't hang up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:54.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我了解…等等 先别挂电话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:57.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But what about a recreational activity?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:57.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一起从事休闲活动如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.15,0:12:59.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I bet we share some common interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.15,0:12:59.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我敢说我俩有共同的兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.49,0:13:02.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell me an interest of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.49,0:13:02.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉我你有什么兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:06.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? On actual horses?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:06.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？骑真的马？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:10.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell me another interest of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:10.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉我你的另一个兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.33,0:13:14.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'm sorry. I have no desire to get in the water till I absolutely have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.33,0:13:14.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 我完全不想碰水 除非有绝对必要
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.67,0:13:17.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell me another interest of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.67,0:13:17.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉我你的另一个兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.05,0:13:19.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Uh-oh, he's stuck in an infinite loop. -I can fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.05,0:13:21.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他受困于无限循环中 -让我来解决
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Mm-hm. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.51,0:13:26.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's interesting but isn't ventriloquism by definition a solo activity?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.51,0:13:26.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真有趣 但腹语是由 一个人进行的活动 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:29.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Tell me another interest of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:30.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 告诉我你的另一个兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.73,0:13:30.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:34.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there any chance you like monkeys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:34.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有可能喜欢猴子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.36,0:13:35.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, what is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.36,0:13:35.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有什么毛病？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:38.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everybody likes monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:38.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所有人都喜欢猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.69,0:13:40.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on, Kripke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.69,0:13:40.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 克里普基
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A loop counter and an escape to the least objectionable activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}循环计数器以及 跳脱到最不令人反感的活动
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:49.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, that's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:49.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 你太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.04,0:13:51.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm surprised you saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.04,0:13:51.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没想到你竟然能想到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:56.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gee, why can't Sheldon make friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:56.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 谢尔顿为何交不到朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:14:00.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. That last interest strikes me as the least objectionable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:14:00.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 克里普基 你的最后一项兴趣 在我看来最不令人反感
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.17,0:14:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I would like to propose that we do that together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.17,0:14:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我建议我们俩一起进行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:05.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:05.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}明天
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.05,0:14:08.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.05,0:14:08.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 由我付钱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.22,0:14:10.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.22,0:14:10.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:15.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Time to learn rock climbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:15.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该学习如何攀岩了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I am a fan of ventriloquism.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实我超喜欢腹语
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:29.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe you, me and your dummy could go get a hot beverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:29.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你、我和你的人偶 可以一起去喝杯热饮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:32.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He could talk while you drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:32.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你喝的时候由它来聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:35.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nope. I wanna climb some rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:35.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我要来攀岩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:46.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This appears significantly more monolithic than it did on my laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:46.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这看起来比我笔记本电脑上的画面更壮观
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:51.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, one expects to see hominids learning to use bones as weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:51.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没人想得到猿人 会学习拿骨头当武器
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.43,0:14:53.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, you afraid of heights, Cooper? -Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.43,0:14:53.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你有恐高症吗 库珀？ -几乎没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.77,0:14:56.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A fear of heights is illogical.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.77,0:14:56.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}害怕高处毫无逻辑可言
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:59.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fear of falling, on the other hand, is prudent and evolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:59.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}害怕摔下来则是 演化过程中的明智产物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:02.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What would you say is the minimum altitude...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你认为我要爬多高…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:05.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I need to achieve to cement our newfound friendship?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:05.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才能与你建立一段全新的友谊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:09.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, they have birthday parties here. Little kids climb this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:09.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 有人在这里办生日派对 连小孩子都会爬
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.87,0:15:13.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[WHISPERS] Little kid hominids, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.87,0:15:13.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许是小猿人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:19.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN NORMAL VOICE] So is this your entire job?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:19.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就是你全部的工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.71,0:15:22.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your parents must be so proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.71,0:15:22.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你爸妈想必非常骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.88,0:15:24.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's go, Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.88,0:15:24.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爬吧 库珀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:26.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Coming, Kripke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:26.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来了 克里普基
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:30.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, harness seems to be secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:30.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 索具似乎很坚固
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.56,0:15:34.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A small amount of incontinence just now, but the website said that's to be expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.56,0:15:34.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我现在有点尿失禁 但网站上说这是正常现象
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:38.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:38.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.69,0:15:40.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This isn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.69,0:15:40.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这其实并不太糟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.32,0:15:43.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a bit like vertical swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.32,0:15:43.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像垂直游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:47.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at you. You're almost halfway to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:47.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看你 库珀 你已经爬了一半
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:48.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am? I--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:48.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？我…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.03,0:15:52.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.03,0:15:52.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我错了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.49,0:15:55.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is a fear of heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.49,0:15:55.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的确有恐高症
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:57.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You all right there, Cooper? -Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:57.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你还好吗 库珀？ -不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:16:01.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I feel like an inverse tangent function that's approaching an asymptote.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:16:01.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我感觉像是 接近渐近线的反正切函数
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:04.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Stuck? -What part of "inverse tangent function...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:04.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你是说你被困住了？ -你是听不懂…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.09,0:16:06.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...approaching an asymptote" did you not understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.09,0:16:06.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接近渐近线的反正切函数的哪个部分？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:09.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I understood all of it, I'm not a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:09.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我全都了解 我不是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:10.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:10.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}继续爬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.30,0:16:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I don't think I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.30,0:16:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:14.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, then climb back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:14.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就往下爬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:18.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that doesn't seem any more likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:18.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这也不太可能
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:19.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what's the plan, Cooper?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:19.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你有什么计划 库珀？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.35,0:16:25.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it's not exactly a plan but I think I'm going to pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.35,0:16:25.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不算是个计划 但我觉得我要昏倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:37.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, can we just do it one more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:37.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 我们可以再来一次吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:38.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:38.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:40.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One, two. One, two, three and....
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:40.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一 二 三…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:43.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[ALL WHISTLING "SWEET GEORGIA BROWN"]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.72,0:16:53.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[ALL LAUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.14,0:16:58.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a little thing but you really do miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.14,0:16:58.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吹口哨虽然可有可无 但还真的挺令人怀念的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.02,0:17:00.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.02,0:17:00.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.27,0:17:03.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I brought my new friend, Barry Kripke, home for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.27,0:17:03.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我带了我的新朋友贝瑞克里普基 回家吃晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.81,0:17:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[ALL GROAN]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.07,0:17:07.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello to you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.07,0:17:07.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:09.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How was rock climbing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:09.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}攀岩好玩吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:11.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:11.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他昏倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:13.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just hung there like a big salami.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:13.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像一条大香肠般挂在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.37,0:17:17.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Eh, eh, eh. That's where I sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.37,0:17:17.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我的座位
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:20.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, you have a special spot. What kind of wacko are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:20.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还有特别座位？ 你是哪门子怪胎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:23.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How much time you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:23.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有多少时间？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:26.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want some Chinese food?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:26.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要吃点中国菜吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:28.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Terrific. Got any dental floss?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:28.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 这里有牙线吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:30.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:30.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在浴室里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.59,0:17:32.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.59,0:17:32.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.09,0:17:36.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I gotta floss the Indian food out of my teeth if I'm gonna eat Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.09,0:17:36.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若我要吃中国菜 就得先把牙缝里的印度菜剔干净
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.89,0:17:39.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.89,0:17:39.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:42.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yes. I pass out all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:42.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事 我经常会昏倒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:46.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it was worth it. I've made substantial progress in bonding with Kripke...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:46.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是很值得 我和克里普基的友谊大有进展
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:49.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which brings me to an awkward moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:49.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我想到一件很尴尬的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.44,0:17:52.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's that? -Maintaining five friendships...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.44,0:17:52.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -维持与五个人的友谊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:55.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...promises to be a Herculean task.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:55.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来会是桩艰巨的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.95,0:17:58.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I'm going to have to let one of you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.95,0:17:58.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我得放弃你们其中一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.79,0:18:03.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[WHISPERS] Me, me, let it be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.79,0:18:03.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我 拜托选我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, you are my roommate, my source of transportation...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 你是我室友 我的交通工具
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:13.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you help me fold my sheets when they come out of the dryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:13.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的床单烘干完毕之后 你也帮我折叠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.13,0:18:15.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.13,0:18:15.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.14,0:18:18.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Can I whistle? -Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.14,0:18:18.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我能吹口哨吗？ -别傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:20.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:20.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.43,0:18:22.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you do not have a Ph.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.43,0:18:22.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没有博士学位
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:25.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your cologne is an assault on the senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:25.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且古龙水的味道很难闻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.81,0:18:29.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you're not available for video games during the Jewish High Holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.81,0:18:29.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在犹太重大节日期间都无法打游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.69,0:18:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Guilty as charged. I'm out. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.69,0:18:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-罪证确凿 我出局 -不
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:35.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You, too, are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.03,0:18:36.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[HOWARD SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:39.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on. What do I have to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:39.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 我该怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.33,0:18:41.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, you know what? I see where this is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.33,0:18:41.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗？我知道结果如何
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:43.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not one of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:43.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是你们其中之一
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm not a scientist, so-- SHELDON: Penny...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不是科学家 所以… -佩妮…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...everything you're saying is true, but please allow me to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说的一切都属实 但是请让我说完
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.17,0:18:50.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Raj, you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.17,0:18:50.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 你出局了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.76,0:18:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.76,0:18:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个问题很好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:19:00.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}While you do provide a certain cultural diversity...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:19:00.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的确在这个同质性很高的团体中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:04.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to a homogenous group, your responses to the questionnaire were truly disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:04.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}带来了文化差异 但你问卷上的答案很令人不解
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.02,0:19:09.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How could you for a moment think that my favorite amino acid is glutamine?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.02,0:19:09.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么会认为 我最爱的氨基酸是谷氨酰胺？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.36,0:19:10.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[WHISPERING INDISTINCTLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.19,0:19:13.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-He had lysine but changed it. SHELDON: Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.19,0:19:13.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他原本写的离氨基酸 但是改掉了 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.36,0:19:15.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Should have, would have, could have, Raj.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.36,0:19:15.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}千金难买早知道 拉吉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.53,0:19:20.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I like to floss before I eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.53,0:19:20.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢在吃饭前剔牙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.45,0:19:23.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so my gum pockets are open for new food.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.45,0:19:23.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}牙龈袋才能容纳新的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.50,0:19:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ew.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.50,0:19:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:29.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:29.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:33.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How did I walk past you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:33.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚才怎么会没看见你？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:34.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:34.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是贝瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:37.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Penny. -Eh, that's not a very hot name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:37.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 -这个名字不够性感
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.89,0:19:40.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna call you "Roxanne."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.89,0:19:40.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要叫你罗珊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:43.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, pot stickers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:43.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有锅贴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.89,0:19:47.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Suddenly, I'm looking pretty good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.89,0:19:47.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}突然间我还不错 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:54.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, uh, Kripke, I was wondering if there's any chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:54.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克里普基 我在想你是否有可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.36,0:19:57.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you could get me some time on the Open Science Grid computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.36,0:19:57.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}偶尔让我使用公开科学网格电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:19:59.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:19:59.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不能
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:00.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:00.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不能？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.57,0:20:02.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But we're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.57,0:20:02.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.62,0:20:06.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. No, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.62,0:20:06.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 不能 我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.58,0:20:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.58,0:20:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很疑惑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:12.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was given to understand that you allow your friends time on the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:12.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为你会让你的朋友 使用这台电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:15.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that's wrong. There's an official schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:15.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是这样 使用时间表已经固定
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:17.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have no control over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:17.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也爱莫能助
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:25.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. This entire endeavor seems to have been an exercise in futility.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:25.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的种种努力似乎付诸流水
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.93,0:20:27.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Raj, you're back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.93,0:20:27.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 欢迎你归队
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:32.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He likes monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:32.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他喜欢猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.57,0:20:41.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You gotta give him credit for sticking with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.57,0:20:41.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得敬佩他攀爬的毅力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.41,0:20:43.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't think he had it in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.41,0:20:43.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没想到他有运动天分
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.99,0:20:47.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he almost made it to the top this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.99,0:20:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这次他差点爬到顶端了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:22.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 杨博
